{
  "app": "Peace Be Still",
  "brand": "every-tongue",
  "about": "The app's own robot walk for every PR that changes a screen (boss-os scripts/ops/tap-through.mjs, ship-ready app-review.md). Preview switches only: ?paid=1 (preview paid access, no purchase), ?nights=used (a used week), ?hour=3 (3 AM), /own-night?state=scene|busy|limit|refused|crisis (Write your own night's server replies, fixed TEST words, no network). Each paid line on /paid is mapped to the screen behind it, opened directly with ?paid=1 and checked by text a free screen does not show. Onboarded journeys seed the settings onboarding writes (an adult on the God's Word door, Hush Harbor). No account exists; every request that is not a read is blocked.",
